and not worry about anything.


00:52:10.160 --> 00:52:12.560
It must've been heavy.


00:52:15.632 --> 00:52:19.762
Your consolation payment.


00:52:19.803 --> 00:52:23.295
You know this is how that family
solves any problems, right?


00:52:30.080 --> 00:52:34.540
Convenient for them.
And not bad for us either.


00:52:34.584 --> 00:52:37.451
Get some rest.


00:53:12.422 --> 00:53:14.447
Mrs. Oho!


00:53:25.669 --> 00:53:28.297
Do you still see me


00:53:28.338 --> 00:53:31.603
as that helpless little
high school girl?


00:53:31.641 --> 00:53:32.972
Of course not, ma'am.


00:53:33.009 --> 00:53:34.670
In that case,


00:53:34.711 --> 00:53:36.838
how dare you gossip
about my husband


00:53:36.880 --> 00:53:41.544
behind my back to outsiders?


00:53:41.585 --> 00:53:45.112
Outsiders?
How am I an outsider?


00:53:45.155 --> 00:53:46.349
Mom!


00:53:46.389 --> 00:53:48.380
My deepest apologies, ma'am.


00:53:48.425 --> 00:53:50.859
It won't happen again.


00:53:56.433 --> 00:53:58.526
Hello, Mother.


00:53:58.568 --> 00:54:00.297
Hi.


00:54:02.939 --> 00:54:06.033
- Hae-ra is edgy.
- These days she always is.


00:54:14.818 --> 00:54:17.810
I don't see
the young maid today.


00:54:17.854 --> 00:54:21.620
I sent her to the hospital.
She's not feeling well, sir.


00:54:21.658 --> 00:54:22.852
This late?


00:54:26.263 --> 00:54:28.424
They admitted her
for the night.


00:54:28.465 --> 00:54:31.366
Oh, really?


00:54:31.401 --> 00:54:33.733
She'll be back tomorrow, sir.


00:54:33.770 --> 00:54:35.738
Mrs. Oho?


00:54:35.772 --> 00:54:39.139
Why are you chattering on
this late at night?


00:54:39.175 --> 00:54:43.202
With that annoying
voice of yours.


00:54:43.246 --> 00:54:49.116
And why does it take you hours
to pack a suitcase?


00:54:49.152 --> 00:54:51.950
Is it because you're old?


00:54:59.429 --> 00:55:02.660
I am the mother...


00:55:02.699 --> 00:55:08.035
...of a prosecutor
of the Republic of Korea!


00:55:08.071 --> 00:55:13.270
Revolting, ugly,
nauseating, and shameless!


00:55:19.115 --> 00:55:20.104
R.U.N.S.


00:55:21.117 --> 00:55:22.277
R.U.N.S.


00:55:23.353 --> 00:55:26.447
R.U.N. S!


00:55:30.160 --> 00:55:33.220
- Here's Ms. Lee Eun-yi.
- Thank you.


00:55:36.633 --> 00:55:39.761
We didn't notice it at first.


00:55:39.803 --> 00:55:41.737
See this?


00:55:41.771 --> 00:55:45.207
The fertilized egg
implanted in your womb?


00:55:45.241 --> 00:55:49.234
You're pregnant.
Looks like about four weeks.


00:55:54.951 --> 00:55:58.751
It's a blessing to be pregnant.


00:55:58.788 --> 00:56:01.018
Be brave.


00:56:01.057 --> 00:56:04.288
Was it your boss?


00:56:06.396 --> 00:56:08.057
You'll spend all your savings
giving birth


00:56:08.098 --> 00:56:10.828
and raising the baby.


00:56:12.335 --> 00:56:15.862
But I guess savings are meant
to be spent in times like this.


00:56:15.905 --> 00:56:19.068
Maybe there's some sort of
government support?


00:56:21.277 --> 00:56:23.837
Is it your boss' baby?


00:56:23.880 --> 00:56:28.214
I mean, he's rich and all.


00:56:29.986 --> 00:56:32.045
Have you ever had an abortion?


00:56:36.292 --> 00:56:39.784
You should pack up
and get out of that house now.


00:56:39.829 --> 00:56:41.854
Abortion or not.


00:56:41.898 --> 00:56:43.422
Then what?


00:56:43.466 --> 00:56:48.699
Then what?
You can think about that later.


00:56:48.738 --> 00:56:51.901
Your baby's not going anywhere.


00:56:55.645 --> 00:56:56.805
Thank you.


00:56:58.948 --> 00:57:03.009
There are obstetrics tests
listed on the hospital bill.


00:57:03.052 --> 00:57:05.543
Now she knows she's pregnant.


00:57:07.590 --> 00:57:11.788
Let's see what that bimbo
tries to pull.


00:57:14.164 --> 00:57:18.863
What did he see
in that cheap, common slut?


00:57:21.438 --> 00:57:23.804
I should've pushed her
from someplace higher


00:57:23.840 --> 00:57:26.468
and ended things.


00:57:26.509 --> 00:57:27.669
Damn it.


00:58:16.059 --> 00:58:17.924
I'm sorry, Eun-yi.


00:58:17.961 --> 00:58:21.055
I can't believe
I made a mistake like that.


00:58:21.097 --> 00:58:22.291
You understand, right?


00:58:22.332 --> 00:58:23.492
Yes, ma'am.


00:58:23.533 --> 00:58:25.524
Your friend got you
some herbal medicine?


00:58:25.568 --> 00:58:27.968
I should've done that.


00:58:28.004 --> 00:58:32.566
No, I'm fine, ma'am.
I'll be up again soon.


00:58:32.609 --> 00:58:34.634
I'm late for work.


00:58:34.677 --> 00:58:37.237
Bye.


00:58:41.584 --> 00:58:46.044
Drink that lying down.
Go on. Lie down.


00:58:57.300 --> 00:59:01.100
How could that bastard
do this to me?


00:59:01.137 --> 00:59:05.073
In my house, with the bitch
who washes my underwear.


00:59:05.108 --> 00:59:07.099
You made her wash
your underwear?


00:59:09.112 --> 00:59:12.081
No need for you to resent Hoon.


00:59:14.150 --> 00:59:16.209
From the day he was born,


00:59:16.252 --> 00:59:21.087
he had everything
he ever wanted.


00:59:21.124 --> 00:59:27.324
Whatever he saw,
if he wanted it, it was his.


00:59:27.363 --> 00:59:30.161
No matter what.


00:59:30.199 --> 00:59:34.602
All the men
in that family are like that.


00:59:34.637 --> 00:59:37.105
Look at your mother-in-law.


00:59:37.140 --> 00:59:42.442
She suffered through such awful
things because of those guys.


00:59:42.478 --> 00:59:46.710
Normal people
can't even imagine it.


00:59:46.749 --> 00:59:51.982
But she endured it all
to become who she is today.


00:59:52.021 --> 00:59:55.821
And look at her now.


00:59:55.858 --> 01:00:01.125
Everyone worships
the ground she walks on.


01:00:01.164 --> 01:00:03.758
You'll be like that, too.


01:00:03.800 --> 01:00:07.236
And your children
will be like Hoon.


01:00:07.270 --> 01:00:11.502
That's what both
you and I want, isn't it?


01:00:13.843 --> 01:00:20.248
Let him sleep around
all he wants.


01:00:20.283 --> 01:00:25.243
Later, you can enjoy yourself
and live like a queen.


01:02:34.951 --> 01:02:36.145
You know...


01:02:39.188 --> 01:02:41.748
This house is kind of scary.


01:02:41.791 --> 01:02:42.780
Why?


01:02:46.062 --> 01:02:49.554
Last night...


01:02:49.599 --> 01:02:51.089
What about last night?


01:02:55.705 --> 01:02:58.003
Had a nightmare?


01:03:01.644 --> 01:03:04.704
I think I'd better
quit working here.


01:03:14.090 --> 01:03:18.459
Then pack up now and go.


01:03:18.494 --> 01:03:20.086
But until they find
someone else...


01:03:20.129 --> 01:03:21.460
Look.


01:03:21.497 --> 01:03:25.627
No one in this family will care
that you're gone.


01:03:25.668 --> 01:03:29.297
Just go.


01:03:29.338 --> 01:03:30.635
But I should tell them...


01:03:30.673 --> 01:03:33.870
Just cut the bullshit
and leave.


01:03:49.358 --> 01:03:55.820
What if she shows up one day
with her baby?


01:03:55.865 --> 01:04:00.063
You think a few million dollars
would solve the problem?


01:04:00.102 --> 01:04:03.833
She'll hinder you for life,


01:04:03.873 --> 01:04:08.901
and be a thorn in the side
of Nami and the twins, too.


01:04:08.945 --> 01:04:11.641
You should deal with it now.


01:04:11.681 --> 01:04:16.618
Make her get rid of it
before it's too late.


01:04:22.225 --> 01:04:24.557
Come in.


01:04:26.996 --> 01:04:28.896
Sit down.


01:04:33.102 --> 01:04:38.699
I'm sorry to say this.
But something came up.


01:04:38.741 --> 01:04:42.438
What is it?


01:04:42.478 --> 01:04:46.574
It's a family matter.


01:04:53.656 --> 01:04:55.851
What are you doing?


01:05:03.900 --> 01:05:06.664
I said, what are you doing?


01:05:09.772 --> 01:05:15.768
I treated you
humanely and nicely.


01:05:18.447 --> 01:05:19.471
Didn't I?


01:05:36.032 --> 01:05:37.659
I'm sorry, ma'am.


01:05:41.437 --> 01:05:43.029
About what?


01:05:55.284 --> 01:05:57.548
I'll see myself out.


01:05:57.586 --> 01:06:00.384
Stay right there, please.


01:06:00.423 --> 01:06:02.948
I apologize.


01:06:02.992 --> 01:06:04.823
For what?


01:06:13.703 --> 01:06:15.933
Mother?


01:06:16.939 --> 01:06:18.873
Sit up straight.


01:06:25.648 --> 01:06:27.912
Let's go get an abortion.


01:06:30.553 --> 01:06:33.147
Then you can take this
and leave.


01:06:33.189 --> 01:06:36.022
Then we'll all go back
to living in peace.


01:06:38.694 --> 01:06:41.857
That's a $100,000 check.


01:06:45.134 --> 01:06:48.535
That thing inside you,
it's nothing.


01:06:48.571 --> 01:06:52.803
You can just cut it off,
like a cyst.


01:06:56.045 --> 01:06:59.708
Think wisely.


01:06:59.749 --> 01:07:02.741
But how did you all know?


01:07:04.587 --> 01:07:07.249
I'll give you a few days,


01:07:07.289 --> 01:07:13.694
but you won't get your way,
ever.


01:07:38.421 --> 01:07:42.323
She's been so affectionate
to the kids in my stomach.


01:07:42.358 --> 01:07:44.485
So her own kid...


01:07:48.164 --> 01:07:52.533
She won't give up the baby
for all the money in the world.


01:07:52.568 --> 01:07:54.058
Never.


01:08:05.214 --> 01:08:08.308
Stupid!
Imbecile!


01:08:23.365 --> 01:08:27.324
I should've
thought of Madam...


01:08:27.369 --> 01:08:30.361
I did a horrible thing.


01:08:30.406 --> 01:08:33.432
It's her husband
who should've thought of her.


01:08:38.747 --> 01:08:42.649
Did the hospital tell them
I am pregnant?


01:08:55.164 --> 01:08:58.429
If you want more money, ask.
They'll pay.


01:08:58.467 --> 01:09:00.833
And forget the baby.


01:09:07.209 --> 01:09:09.803
Look.


01:09:09.845 --> 01:09:12.712
Do you really want to
have this baby and bring it up?


01:09:15.951 --> 01:09:17.384
I'm not sure.


01:09:25.594 --> 01:09:28.995
Why'd you just stand still
and let her slap you like that?


01:09:32.835 --> 01:09:34.302
I'm sorry.


01:09:34.336 --> 01:09:38.272
Don't be sorry!
Damn!


01:09:59.762 --> 01:10:01.229
You're still awake?


01:10:02.598 --> 01:10:06.694
You sleep first, tonight.
I'll watch over you.


01:10:24.520 --> 01:10:27.853
I'm sorry.


01:10:27.890 --> 01:10:29.881
About what?


01:10:29.925 --> 01:10:32.985
Grandma pushing the ladder
on purpose.


01:10:39.068 --> 01:10:40.433
I saw it.


01:10:46.041 --> 01:10:52.640
It was an accident
because of the vacuum cleaner.


01:11:04.426 --> 01:11:08.487
You're a good person.
I feel bad.


01:12:01.216 --> 01:12:03.207
"Herbal medicine"


01:12:28.177 --> 01:12:32.375
- Mrs. Oho!
- Yes?


01:12:32.414 --> 01:12:34.439
Tell her to move
out of this room.


01:12:34.483 --> 01:12:37.281
Pardon?


01:12:37.319 --> 01:12:40.220
Put her in your room
and keep an eye on her.


01:13:19.795 --> 01:13:21.763
Why did you move to this room?


01:13:27.703 --> 01:13:29.364
A new nanny will come.


01:13:31.240 --> 01:13:33.834
Why?
Are you sick?


01:13:33.876 --> 01:13:35.810
It's not that.


01:13:38.013 --> 01:13:41.414
There's a baby
inside my tummy, too.


01:13:41.450 --> 01:13:43.577
Is it a boy or a girl?


01:13:46.054 --> 01:13:49.956
I hope it's a girl like you.


01:13:49.992 --> 01:13:53.257
I'm not sure yet.


01:13:53.295 --> 01:13:55.092
It's still too small, right?


01:14:01.136 --> 01:14:02.831
Nami...


01:14:02.871 --> 01:14:05.704
Yes?


01:14:05.741 --> 01:14:07.504
Nami...


01:14:12.848 --> 01:14:16.249
Nami?
Your mother's waiting.


01:14:16.285 --> 01:14:17.775
Bye, Eun-yi.


01:14:28.831 --> 01:14:30.492
I hope you deliver safely.


01:14:30.532 --> 01:14:33.126
- Where were you?
- Never mind.


01:14:37.673 --> 01:14:42.167
Keep an eye on that woman.


01:14:42.211 --> 01:14:44.372
Yes.


01:15:06.034 --> 01:15:09.834
What a relief!


01:15:11.607 --> 01:15:13.404
Liberation!


01:15:44.172 --> 01:15:46.106
Madam Oho?


01:15:55.083 --> 01:15:58.644
I'm having this baby.


01:16:06.895 --> 01:16:09.090
Go ahead.


01:16:23.912 --> 01:16:27.439
Hello, Mother.
Thank you for being here.


01:16:27.482 --> 01:16:30.349
Right on time
despite being so busy.


01:16:30.385 --> 01:16:32.012
Go on in.


01:17:01.683 --> 01:17:03.810
Let's eat.


01:17:08.557 --> 01:17:11.685
They even took my cell phone.


01:17:22.037 --> 01:17:23.095
Sit.


01:17:32.381 --> 01:17:36.750
What do they think
they can do to my baby?


01:17:40.088 --> 01:17:42.579
These people are scary.


01:17:42.624 --> 01:17:46.060
I'm scared something awful
might happen to you.


01:18:27.402 --> 01:18:29.427
Bravo.


01:18:33.141 --> 01:18:34.972
Well done, my sweetie.


01:18:36.745 --> 01:18:39.213
Thank you, honey.


01:18:54.663 --> 01:18:59.066
Get some rest.
I'll go change and come back.


01:19:08.410 --> 01:19:11.777
Son of a bitch.


01:19:11.813 --> 01:19:15.749
That's enough, okay?
Stop there.


01:19:15.784 --> 01:19:18.014
After these precious angels
were just born...


01:20:37.299 --> 01:20:40.359
My stomach.


01:20:52.013 --> 01:20:54.106
I don't need anything.


01:21:21.443 --> 01:21:24.207
Damn bitch.
How dare she!


01:22:00.682 --> 01:22:04.243
What are you doing there?


01:22:04.286 --> 01:22:08.222
I was feeling
under the weather.


01:22:08.256 --> 01:22:10.190
Wanna join me?


01:22:13.194 --> 01:22:15.856
As you wish...


01:22:15.897 --> 01:22:19.094
Were the twins born?


01:22:19.134 --> 01:22:21.500
What's wrong with you?


01:22:25.740 --> 01:22:28.004
I'm pregnant.


01:22:37.786 --> 01:22:41.187
But the ladies of the house
found out everything.


01:22:44.659 --> 01:22:47.719
They really smacked me around.


01:22:50.165 --> 01:22:53.328
They said they'd give me
$100,000 if I have an abortion.


01:22:58.006 --> 01:23:00.201
But I'm having this baby.


01:23:02.844 --> 01:23:06.974
What are you doing in there?


01:23:07.015 --> 01:23:08.812
Get out of there, now!


01:23:24.399 --> 01:23:29.268
I know you don't even
think of me as human.


01:23:29.304 --> 01:23:31.738
But this baby is yours!


01:23:52.093 --> 01:23:56.996
No! Don't do this!
No, baby!


01:24:37.839 --> 01:24:41.331
I'll just disappear quietly
and live with my baby.


01:24:43.211 --> 01:24:47.204
I couldn't hurt anyone,
and I don't need money.


01:24:49.984 --> 01:24:56.412
You're the father.
This is your baby, too.


01:24:57.559 --> 01:24:59.151
Calm down, Ms. Lee.


01:25:02.931 --> 01:25:05.161
Let's have the baby, okay?


01:25:13.708 --> 01:25:16.973
Thank you, Mr. Goh.


01:25:17.011 --> 01:25:19.844
Sorry for getting pregnant
from someone like you.


01:25:43.304 --> 01:25:45.465
She was squirming
in such pain,


01:25:45.507 --> 01:25:47.407
I gave her a shot
of something strong.


01:25:47.442 --> 01:25:50.002
Good work.


01:25:50.044 --> 01:25:53.775
The men in this family
are really something.


01:25:53.815 --> 01:25:56.306
- See you.
- Bye.


01:25:56.351 --> 01:25:58.410
Pack her things
and send her out.


01:25:58.453 --> 01:26:00.387
Don't let her back here, ever.


01:26:00.421 --> 01:26:01.888
Yes, ma'am.


01:26:04.259 --> 01:26:06.989
Mr. Goh wants to see you.


01:26:07.028 --> 01:26:09.997
- Me?
- Yes.


01:26:10.031 --> 01:26:12.829
- He saw her?
- Yes, ma'am.


01:26:37.725 --> 01:26:40.421
Is the baby dead?
Completely?


01:26:43.598 --> 01:26:49.127
Oh, it seems she fooled around
and came in pregnant.


01:26:51.406 --> 01:26:53.135
Why do you even care?


01:26:53.174 --> 01:26:57.201
Ma'am!
I'll ask the questions.


01:27:02.016 --> 01:27:04.746
The baby's completely erased?


01:27:04.786 --> 01:27:05.946
Yes.


01:27:09.257 --> 01:27:11.248
She said it was my baby.


01:27:11.292 --> 01:27:13.385
Who says?


01:27:19.901 --> 01:27:24.235
She'd say anything to try
to rip some money off us.


01:27:29.978 --> 01:27:33.675
If it wasn't mine,
why go through all the trouble?


01:27:36.951 --> 01:27:40.512
Did you slip her some poison?


01:27:40.555 --> 01:27:42.523
It wasn't me.


01:27:42.557 --> 01:27:45.993
Then who was it?


01:27:46.027 --> 01:27:47.585
Your daughter?


01:27:53.334 --> 01:27:56.462
Sorry.
It was me.


01:27:56.504 --> 01:27:59.200
Are you completely insane?


01:28:01.109 --> 01:28:04.977
This is a real shock to me.


01:28:05.013 --> 01:28:08.676
It's my child.


01:28:08.716 --> 01:28:12.618
How dare you think
you can do that?


01:28:12.654 --> 01:28:14.849
Who has the nerve!


01:28:23.131 --> 01:28:25.099
Look.


01:28:25.133 --> 01:28:26.725
Is it not my child


01:28:26.768 --> 01:28:30.499
if your daughter
doesn't give birth to it?


01:28:30.538 --> 01:28:32.062
Is that it?


01:28:37.111 --> 01:28:39.909
No, course not.


01:29:07.508 --> 01:29:09.237
Did you get a signature?


01:29:09.277 --> 01:29:12.974
Just do it.
It's an emergency.


01:29:32.333 --> 01:29:35.131
Isn't that woman outside
her mother?


01:29:37.939 --> 01:29:40.305
No.
It's no one.


01:30:10.371 --> 01:30:13.932
It was probably Hae-ra
who did it.


01:30:18.312 --> 01:30:22.874
Scary people.
Probably why they're so rich.


01:30:26.087 --> 01:30:29.887
Nami said...


01:30:29.924 --> 01:30:34.793
She saw her grandmother push me
from the second floor.


01:30:34.829 --> 01:30:40.290
She apologized,
and said she felt sorry for me.


01:30:43.004 --> 01:30:45.234
Kids don't lie.


01:30:45.273 --> 01:30:49.039
But I didn't even know
I was pregnant then!


01:30:52.280 --> 01:30:54.339
I did.


01:30:54.382 --> 01:30:59.513
Nothing goes on in that house
without me knowing.


01:31:01.022 --> 01:31:02.683
I knew everything.


01:31:11.098 --> 01:31:17.367
When you came home
from the hospital,


01:31:17.405 --> 01:31:20.533
your baby's fate was decided.


01:31:20.575 --> 01:31:22.509
Even if I hadn't told them...


01:31:31.252 --> 01:31:33.686
I'm sorry.


01:31:40.294 --> 01:31:41.727
I'm ashamed.


01:31:44.565 --> 01:31:45.759
But a woman like me...


01:31:47.668 --> 01:31:49.829
...it's in my bones.


01:32:13.961 --> 01:32:18.489
Take this and find someone nice.


01:32:18.533 --> 01:32:22.833
You'll be fine,
you have a good heart.


01:32:33.848 --> 01:32:37.944
I'm going to get revenge.


01:32:39.587 --> 01:32:43.079
I know.
Anyone would want to.


01:32:46.561 --> 01:32:52.158
No! However small,
I have to do something!


01:33:16.924 --> 01:33:20.485
Damned world has been
so cruel to me.


01:33:22.229 --> 01:33:25.562
You poor thing.


01:33:25.600 --> 01:33:29.127
I'll apologize for them.
Happy?


01:33:33.908 --> 01:33:38.607
Their daughter, Nami...


01:33:38.646 --> 01:33:42.480
She was genuinely nice to me.


01:33:42.516 --> 01:33:45.041
Stop thinking about it.


01:33:47.088 --> 01:33:50.990
I wanted to have a pretty
little daughter like her.


01:33:52.893 --> 01:33:56.090
A girl who's kind to me.


01:33:56.130 --> 01:33:59.031
Wipe those thoughts
from your head.


01:34:05.740 --> 01:34:08.038
I smell like the restaurant,
don't I?


01:34:10.378 --> 01:34:12.403
No.


01:34:12.446 --> 01:34:18.783
Go to sleep.
And forget it ever happened.


01:34:32.299 --> 01:34:37.669
R.U.N.S., R.U.N.S.


01:35:06.067 --> 01:35:08.592
We haven't done it for ages.


01:35:12.773 --> 01:35:15.264
You're unclean.


01:35:15.309 --> 01:35:16.867
Me?


01:35:16.911 --> 01:35:19.243
Put your hand
on your heart and think.


01:35:29.657 --> 01:35:31.124
All right.


01:35:31.158 --> 01:35:36.118
Still, tell me when you're ready
for our 4th and 5th kids.


01:36:53.307 --> 01:36:54.296
Ms. Lee!


01:36:57.311 --> 01:36:58.938
What the hell
are you doing here?


01:36:58.979 --> 01:37:01.311
"What the hell
are you doing here?"


01:37:10.357 --> 01:37:14.088
- Leave the baby alone.
- "Leave the baby alone."


01:37:27.808 --> 01:37:30.971
- Go, go!
- I'm going!


01:37:31.011 --> 01:37:32.308
- Honey!
- "Honey!"


01:37:32.346 --> 01:37:34.075
- Honey!
- "Honey!"


01:37:35.983 --> 01:37:37.507
What's going on?


01:37:37.551 --> 01:37:39.678
She's crazy!


01:37:41.989 --> 01:37:46.358
Mrs. Oho?
How did that bimbo get in here?


01:37:46.393 --> 01:37:47.883
Who let her in?


01:37:47.928 --> 01:37:50.055
Kick her out, now.


01:37:50.097 --> 01:37:52.122
Call the men
if you can't do it alone.


01:37:52.166 --> 01:37:56.227
I quit.
I'm leaving this house, now.


01:37:56.270 --> 01:37:58.738
What's this all of a sudden?


01:37:58.772 --> 01:38:02.708
I'm already packed to go.


01:38:02.743 --> 01:38:06.440
Where do you get the nerve?


01:38:06.480 --> 01:38:10.849
Chase that crazy bitch out
before you go!


01:38:10.885 --> 01:38:14.321
Never shut up, do you?


01:38:14.355 --> 01:38:16.983
From now on, if you want
something do it yourselves.


01:38:17.024 --> 01:38:19.219
I quit.


01:38:19.260 --> 01:38:22.593
What are you doing, Mrs. Oho!


01:38:22.630 --> 01:38:25.622
What the hell are you doing?


01:38:25.666 --> 01:38:27.600
You really want to
live like this?


01:38:31.338 --> 01:38:33.863
This is what these people
are like.


01:38:33.908 --> 01:38:35.205
Just ignore her.


01:38:35.242 --> 01:38:38.473
Eun-yi!


01:38:38.512 --> 01:38:41.276
Nami, how have you been?


01:38:41.315 --> 01:38:45.149
Okay.
What about you?


01:38:45.185 --> 01:38:49.019
You must be so happy to have
two angelic little brothers.


01:38:49.056 --> 01:38:50.182
It's so-so.


01:38:52.226 --> 01:38:55.855
What about the baby
inside your tummy?


01:38:55.896 --> 01:38:58.023
My baby?


01:38:58.065 --> 01:38:59.623
It died.


01:38:59.667 --> 01:39:01.931
Why?


01:39:16.283 --> 01:39:18.717
Eun-yi?


01:39:18.752 --> 01:39:20.447
Don't do it.


01:39:20.487 --> 01:39:22.114
Walk out of here with me.


01:39:22.156 --> 01:39:25.648
I can't get it
out of my head...


01:39:25.693 --> 01:39:28.025
what happened here.


01:39:28.062 --> 01:39:32.431
It's so horrible...


01:39:32.466 --> 01:39:36.027
I can't take it anymore.
That's why.


01:39:36.070 --> 01:39:38.265
Ms. Lee.


01:39:38.305 --> 01:39:43.971
I apologize for what happened.
I'll settle with you as needed.


01:39:44.011 --> 01:39:45.535
You know me.


01:39:51.085 --> 01:39:55.112
Nami.
Thank you for everything.


01:39:55.155 --> 01:39:59.285
I'm sorry to you,
and the twins.


01:39:59.326 --> 01:40:01.521
Don't forget me!
Promise!


01:40:01.562 --> 01:40:03.189
What's she doing?


01:40:18.579 --> 01:40:21.013
Fire!


01:40:35.963 --> 01:40:38.295
Let's get out of here!


01:42:08.589 --> 01:42:13.925
Happy birthday to you


01:42:15.496 --> 01:42:21.093
Happy birthday to you


01:42:22.636 --> 01:42:26.970
Happy birthday


01:42:27.007 --> 01:42:31.774
My precious girl


01:42:31.812 --> 01:42:35.976
Happy birthday...

